# medEco Environment Configuration & WhatsApp Gateway Settings

# ==============================================================================
# OPTION 1: UltraMsg WhatsApp API (Easiest & Fastest Third-Party Gateway)
# 1. Register free trial at https://ultramsg.com
# 2. Scan QR code with the Store Owner's WhatsApp (+91 9030481507)
# 3. Paste Instance ID and Token below:
# ==============================================================================
VITE_ULTRAMSG_INSTANCE_ID=
VITE_ULTRAMSG_TOKEN=

# ==============================================================================
# OPTION 2: Green API (Free WhatsApp Developer Instance)
# 1. Register at https://green-api.com
# 2. Scan QR code in Green API console with Owner's WhatsApp
# 3. Paste idInstance and apiTokenInstance below:
# ==============================================================================
VITE_GREENAPI_ID_INSTANCE=
VITE_GREENAPI_API_TOKEN=

# ==============================================================================
# OPTION 3: Custom Webhook / WPPConnect Gateway
# ==============================================================================
VITE_WHATSAPP_WEBHOOK_URL=
VITE_WHATSAPP_WEBHOOK_KEY=

# ==============================================================================
# OPTION 4: Meta WhatsApp Cloud API (Official Business API)
# ==============================================================================
VITE_WHATSAPP_CLOUD_API_TOKEN=
VITE_WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=
